# Beorn the Fierce, a 6/6 Bear: "Other Bears you control get +2/+2. At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a trample counter on
# up to one target creature you control. It becomes a Bear in addition to its other types. Then if you control three or more Bears,
# draw two cards." Bot1 controls Beorn and Grizzly Bears (a 4/4 with the bonus, Beorn himself getting none): only two Bears. At
# combat the Ornithopter (not a Bear) gets a trample counter and becomes a Bear (no duration, CR 205.1b: still one on turn 3, and a
# 2/4 with the +2/+2), and "Then" it is counted: three Bears, two cards drawn (CR 608.2c).

